        "accordion_dWgcNj": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "show_below_gallery": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Craftsmanship",
            "content": "<p>Handcrafted in India by generational artisans, every Bisha Oushak rug is woven using centuries-old techniques inspired by Persian and Anatolian traditions. From selecting the finest wool to tying every individual knot by hand, each rug is crafted with remarkable patience, precision, and care.<br/><br/><strong>The Making Process:<br/></strong> Premium New Zealand wool is carefully selected and prepared.<br/>Natural dyes create soft, timeless color palettes with subtle tonal variation<br/>.Every knot is tied by hand on a traditional loom.<br/>Each rug is trimmed, washed, and carefully inspected before shipment.<br/><br/><strong> Features: </strong><br/><br/>Generational artisan craftsmanship<br/>Oversized signature motifs<br/>Soft pastel color palette<br/>Inspired by historic Oushak designs<br/><br/><br/><br/></p>",
            "liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "tag_1_text": "Eco-Friendly",
